# My Shopping 2025

A modern shopping application built with Spring Boot and Vaadin framework.

## Application Overview
This is a web-based shopping platform that provides:
- Secure user authentication system
- Clean and intuitive user interface
- Responsive design with custom theming

## Features
- User login and registration functionality
- Personalized user dashboard
- Custom theme with professional color scheme


## Technical Stack
- Backend: Spring Boot, Jakarta EE
- Frontend: Vaadin Flow
- Theme: Custom "my-theme"
- Database: Not implemented yet

## Getting Started
1. Launch the application
2. Use the provided test credentials or register a new account
3. Access your personalized shopping dashboard
